{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06063","headline":"奉和圣制与太子诸王三月三日龙池春禊应制 · 王维","name":"奉和圣制与太子诸王三月三日龙池春禊应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"故事修春禊，新宫展豫游。\n明君移凤辇，太子出龙楼。\n赋掩陈王作，桮如洛水流。\n金人来捧劒，画鷁去回舟。\n苑树浮宫阙，天池照冕旒。\n宸章在云表，垂象满皇州。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王维","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_06063.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_06063","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}